    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6233" root="جم" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمَّانٌ</span></b>  A measure, (S,) such as is called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكُّوك</span>,
(K,) <i>filled so as to have what is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُمَام</span>;
(S, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمَّامٌ</span></b> : (K:) [fem. of the former
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمَّى</span>. Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُمْجُمَةٌ جَمَّى</span> [<i>A</i>] <i>full</i> [<i>bowl</i>].
(K. In the CK <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمْجَمَةٌ</span>.)

